    "Academic Calendar - Bordeaux Montaigne University v1.2\nGo to content\nGo to search\nGo to menu\nAcademic Calendar - Bordeaux Montaigne University v1.2\nShare\nShare on Facebook\nShare on LinkedIn\nSend by Mail\nYour name\n*\nYour mail\n*\nRecipient(s)\n*\nSeparated by coma\nMessage\nImage's text\n*\nIf the image is not clear enough, you can refresh the page.\nAcademic calendar\nAt Bordeaux Montaigne University, the academic calendar is divided into two semesters:\n- 1st semester: from September to December\n- 2nd semester: from January to April\n2026/2027 academic calendar\nOrientation day for exchange students\nThursday, 3 September, 2026\nStart of the 1st semester classes (S1)\nMonday, 7 September, 2026\nAutumn break for non-professional classes\nFrom Saturday evening, 23 October to Monday morning, 2 November, 2026\nEnd of the 1st semester classes\nFriday, 18 December 2026\nChristmas Holidays\nFrom Friday, 18 December, 2026 at noon to Monday morning, 4 January, 2027\nOrientation day for exchange students\nThursday, 7 January, 2027\nStart of the 2nd semester classes (S2)\nMonday, 11 January, 2027\nWinter break\nFrom Friday evening, February 19 to Monday morning, March 1, 2027\nSpring break\nFrom Friday evening, 16 April to Monday morning, 26 April 2027\nEnd of 2nd semester classes\nFriday evening, 30 April 2027\nExchange students are exclusively assessed during classes, based on continuous assessment. They do not need to attend examination periods at the end of the semester, except for students enrolled in double degree programmes.\nUniversity closing periods\nWednesday, November 11, 2026 – (Public Holiday)\nFrom Saturday, 21 December 2026 in the evening to Monday, 6 January 2027 in the morning (Christmas Holidays)\nMonday, March 29, 2027 – (Easter)\nSaturday, May 1, 2027 – (International Workers’ Day)\nThursday, May 6 and Friday, May 7, 2027 – (Holy Ascension)\nSaturday, May 8, 2027 – (Public Holiday)\nMonday, May 17, 2027 – (Pentecost)\nWednesday, July 14, 2027 – (National Day)\nFrom Friday evening, July 23, 2027 to Monday morning, August 16, 2027 – Summer Closing Period\nfooter-script"
  ],
